    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BitColony is a sci-fi simulator game where you manage a company charged with colonizing the solar system. Balance company interests, logistics, research, space armadas, politics, buildings, dangerous planets, and outside alien threats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage orders and transports to create a web of resource management throughout the solar system as you supply your far out colonies with resources they can not get on their own planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work towards researching over 100 unique projects that increase your technology level, role in government, building options, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Armadas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds and manage an armada of space ships that can patrol the solar system and defend your transports and planets from extraterrestrial threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Politics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with the dynamic politics system where you can manage relations with multiple political parties. Keep out of government or get your company involved to sway the decisions, or even go as far as overthrowing the government to instate your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique structures on each planet that work towards production, energy, food, resource extraction, or anything else that helps to make your company viable and profitable, while keeping your colonies alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the home world and colonize the several planets and moons that make up the solar system that you have been charged with.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BitColony is a sci-fi simulator game where you manage a company charged with colonizing the solar system. Balance company interests, logistics, research, space armadas, politics, buildings, dangerous planets, and outside alien threats. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Logistics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage orders and transports to create a web of resource management throughout the solar system as you supply your far out colonies with resources they can not get on their own planet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Research</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work towards researching over 100 unique projects that increase your technology level, role in government, building options, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Armadas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Builds and manage an armada of space ships that can patrol the solar system and defend your transports and planets from extraterrestrial threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Politics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with the dynamic politics system where you can manage relations with multiple political parties. Keep out of government or get your company involved to sway the decisions, or even go as far as overthrowing the government to instate your own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Buildings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique structures on each planet that work towards production, energy, food, resource extraction, or anything else that helps to make your company viable and profitable, while keeping your colonies alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the home world and colonize the several planets and moons that make up the solar system that you have been charged with.</p>",
